  "description": "*“I love playing best!”*\n\nI said and now playing has actually become my job?! It’s been 10 years since I started commuting to the world of childhood every day! I thought I knew children inside and out... but their unpredictable words and actions still surprise me all the time. To those children, I always say, “I see,” Stories from a kindergarten teacher, told by Guna, a 10-year veteran of empathy.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
